\f1\fs22 And a quick little fast forward again \'85\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>As the chandeliers came down and the fighting broke out, \cf0 Lonnie\cf2  appeared at Sarah\'92s table. \'91We must get you out of here.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91I\'92m not leaving without Tony,\'92 she said firmly.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>By the wall, the silhouette of a dim figure with minor burns bounced on the balls of his feet.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Him?\'92 \cf0 Lonnie\cf2  asked, incredulous. \'91Sugar, he\'92s \'85 not much. Is he?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91He\'92s coming with me.\'92\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf0 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Lonnie\cf2  hrumphed capitulation, and sent another waiter off to fetch Tony. Johnny took this moment to summon all his courage so he could grab \cf0 Lonnie\cf2  by her jewel-encrusted lapels. \'91I demand you take me as well.\'92 \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Instead, \cf0 Lonnie\cf2  took the Johnny\'92s lights out.
